  "action": "Analyzed WhatsApp cost at scale for 200 chats/day: 6000 convos/mo x 3 bot replies = 18000 service messages, 17000 billable after 1000 free tier = Rp6.7jt/bln at Rp395.88/msg (Rp356.65+PPN). Researched Meta official pricing: service messages have NO volume tiers (flat rate), Meta Business Agent is MORE expensive (~Rp700-880/msg, no free tier), WA Business App is free but no API. Cost levers: reduce messages per convo (1 dense reply = Rp1.98jt), shift traffic to Telegram (80% shift = Rp1.03jt), utility/auth volume tiers don't apply to service"
